Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.86,0:00:04.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小空有危險
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.60,0:00:12.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,判斷風向
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.62,0:00:20.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.24,0:00:25.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.07,0:00:29.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
