Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.14,0:02:08.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}{\c&HFCB856&\3c&HFFF4DE&\4c&HFFFFFF&}{\fs50\pos(1160,970)}飛翼愈衛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.07,0:02:13.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗚...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.57,0:02:16.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行就是不行啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.81,0:02:21.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我這個嘟嘟鳥族怎麼可能飛...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.09,0:02:25.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在不是哭哭啼啼的時候！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.06,0:02:27.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定要把小空救回來！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.59,0:02:33.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是靠腳 別說救了 連城裡都走不到
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.58,0:02:37.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯... 啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.91,0:02:39.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.55,0:02:44.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.32,0:02:56.61,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,跳！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.98,0:02:58.06,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.23,0:03:00.08,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.86,0:03:03.29,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,小兔子跳 可是搆不到這裡的！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.82,0:03:04.86,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,Sky！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.29,0:03:11.39,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哼！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.87,0:03:17.35,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.80,0:03:20.58,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,欸
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.28,0:03:23.06,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,你也太賴皮了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.39,0:03:25.38,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊哇哇... 啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.84,0:03:32.06,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,撐不住了！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.25,0:03:35.77,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,呀哈哈哈哈... 還沒完呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.82,0:03:41.73,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.91,0:03:44.28,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,Sky！用這些！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.82,0:03:51.04,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喲！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.74,0:03:58.48,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,你看
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.72,0:03:59.77,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,看著呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.14,0:04:05.54,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,應該不只有我覺得要糟了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.85,0:04:07.34,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,不是 這下是真要糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.07,0:04:17.47,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小... 小空
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.61,0:04:22.37,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,呀哈哈哈哈... 老子強啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.73,0:04:27.48,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,真想自吹自擂一番啊 不過Precure也算是蠻強的了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.74,0:04:30.34,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,現在要是大意 又要輸了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.00,0:04:33.77,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,在哪裡啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.56,0:04:37.03,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.16,0:04:42.40,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,哈哈哈哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.39,0:04:42.40,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,（飛碟提示音）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.84,0:04:43.89,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.11,0:04:46.82,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.47,0:04:50.23,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,哦喲 嗯...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.42,0:04:52.63,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,先抓這邊吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.79,0:04:53.70,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,（飛碟提示音）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.85,0:04:55.56,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 你又怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.02,0:04:58.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哈... 哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.11,0:05:01.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡疤痛！不准對小空出手！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.08,0:05:04.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我來會會你！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.37,0:05:10.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...但是 我要靠什麼跟他戰鬥啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.88,0:05:13.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.84,0:05:15.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.14,0:05:17.95,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,少來礙事！你個龍套！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.11,0:05:18.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.82,0:05:20.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.50,0:05:21.37,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.69,0:05:23.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.10,0:05:25.55,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.75,0:05:27.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.49,0:05:31.99,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.28,0:05:34.27,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.79,0:05:35.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.55,0:05:38.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快飛遠點！這裡太危險！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.23,0:05:40.33,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.02,0:05:41.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.63,0:05:43.50,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.41,0:05:46.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.34,0:05:52.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝 小空... 嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.55,0:05:53.47,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.76,0:05:57.69,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,哼 吸塵器光線 放！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.99,0:06:03.55,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.73,0:06:04.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.85,0:06:07.00,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,-小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.85,0:06:07.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.87,0:06:09.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們振作一點！快醒醒！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.37,0:06:11.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Sky！Prism！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.08,0:06:14.30,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小蝶？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.13,0:06:17.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.01,0:06:19.22,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.63,0:06:22.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小空從家裡飛了出來 一直追到你們這裡！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.30,0:06:24.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然後就...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.00,0:06:30.30,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.56,0:06:32.91,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,連阿翼都在 為什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.33,0:06:36.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別問為什麼了！先要救他們倆
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.43,0:06:48.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然談不上是什麼好計策
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.80,0:06:50.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜託你們了 Sky！Prism！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.99,0:06:54.04,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(1520,1050)}跳！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.99,0:06:54.04,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(490,1050)}跳！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.51,0:06:57.45,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,上了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.67,0:06:58.74,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.46,0:07:01.79,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,噠！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.91,0:07:06.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,發射！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.15,0:07:07.81,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,噠！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.49,0:07:13.55,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Prism！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.35,0:07:16.66,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我不會辜負你的！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.43,0:07:21.81,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,跳！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.15,0:07:35.14,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,Sky！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.78,0:07:38.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,中止！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.90,0:07:42.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 我這個計策實在是太莽撞了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.29,0:07:44.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們再想想別的...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.85,0:07:45.93,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,-沒關係的！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.85,0:07:45.93,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,-沒關係！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.19,0:07:49.60,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an3}再來一次！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.19,0:07:49.60,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an1}再來一次！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.91,0:08:00.62,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,嗚... 嗚... 小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.79,0:08:01.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.67,0:08:06.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我都在做什麼啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.28,0:08:10.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明明是來救她的 反而扯了後腿...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.33,0:08:21.51,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你小子 是藍天大地的嘟嘟鳥族吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.33,0:08:21.51,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(875,970)}Sky Land
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.74,0:08:22.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是又怎麼了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.40,0:08:26.10,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,噗噗 我聽說過的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.31,0:08:30.35,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,聽說你們是連飛都不會的廢鳥
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.53,0:08:31.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不會把小空交給你的！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.00,0:08:36.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你妄想帶走小空  就先打倒我...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.61,0:08:40.29,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.27,0:08:44.67,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你這小子啊 為什麼要這麼拚命？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.31,0:08:48.54,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,是那什麼嗎？給小公主賣個人情
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.85,0:08:53.23,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,說不定還能得到國王的恩賜 是吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.86,0:08:56.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是的...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.55,0:08:58.22,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啊？那為什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.36,0:09:03.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這麼小的娃娃 被帶到了陌生的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.20,0:09:07.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想要幫助她... 不是理所當然的嗎！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.97,0:09:10.41,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,不覺得
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.59,0:09:12.81,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.81,0:09:15.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.30,0:09:17.36,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你有點討人厭啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.55,0:09:19.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等！欸... 欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.91,0:09:22.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.27,0:09:25.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！啊啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.87,0:09:30.25,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,卡疤痛痛！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.97,0:09:35.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}啊啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.11,0:09:38.09,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡是高高的天上
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.35,0:09:40.93,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,沒人能上到這裡 來救你的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.76,0:09:45.31,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 該回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.49,0:09:49.45,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,去我們黑暗的世界·暗塌谷帝國！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.92,0:10:03.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.05,0:10:05.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還好他是個粗心大意的傢伙 得救了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.89,0:10:09.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是我不行啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.53,0:10:11.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,後面就交給Sky和Prism...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.12,0:10:21.52,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,卡疤疤疤卡疤卡疤 卡疤疤卡疤卡疤 痛痛痛痛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.09,0:10:25.40,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,卡疤卡疤卡疤 卡疤痛痛！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.98,0:10:30.08,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,請聽我說！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.46,0:10:33.10,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,我終於抓到天空公主了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.94,0:10:36.31,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,馬上就帶她前往您處
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.68,0:10:38.15,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,所以！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.32,0:10:42.68,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,按照約定 賜予我更強的力量吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.95,0:10:47.08,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,我還想要100年份的美食
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.35,0:10:50.09,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 約定的好像是10年份
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.26,0:10:54.10,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,這一點嘛 就看在我努力的份上 給多加一點吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.48,0:10:55.03,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}還有還有...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.80,0:10:55.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.20,0:10:59.34,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}還想要一套住起來舒適的產權房呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.20,0:10:59.34,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(1285,150)}My Home
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.51,0:10:57.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噓
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.38,0:11:00.06,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.22,0:11:04.76,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,要有軟綿綿的床 和裝滿食物的大冰箱
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.92,0:11:08.68,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,這麼一來 還想要一位專為我服務的大廚子！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.83,0:11:10.88,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,還有還有... 啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.14,0:11:16.21,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你這個拐騙兒童的！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.13,0:11:18.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你哪有這個資格說我！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.07,0:11:21.09,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,少囉嗦 別跑了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.29,0:11:22.30,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,哇
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.32,0:11:29.66,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,誰啊！到底是誰在這裡亂丟垃圾
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.27,0:11:31.12,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,是我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.02,0:11:40.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 小空 你快走！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.62,0:11:41.70,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.66,0:11:43.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.63,0:11:44.94,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你在哪裡...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.56,0:11:47.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,趕快！你一個人先走！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.45,0:11:48.62,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.31,0:11:50.86,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,找到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.45,0:11:54.46,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.56,0:11:57.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.67,0:11:58.97,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.22,0:12:02.84,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！出來了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.27,0:12:10.81,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.76,0:12:13.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果然沒速度啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.77,0:12:16.83,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,別想逃！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.52,0:12:19.22,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.90,0:12:31.31,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,呀哈哈哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.55,0:12:33.10,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.43,0:12:41.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小空 快逃
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.95,0:12:48.12,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.86,0:12:53.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到最後 我也沒能飛起來...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.55,0:12:56.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哈哈哈哈
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.73,0:12:59.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘟嘟鳥族是不能飛的鳥吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.50,0:13:02.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我就要從眼睛裡射出光線
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.69,0:13:11.98,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.83,0:13:18.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.33,0:13:21.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是小空的力量嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.05,0:13:34.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！不要管我了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.37,0:13:35.14,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.33,0:13:37.60,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.58,0:13:40.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.81,0:13:43.87,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,吸塵器光線 放！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.13,0:13:52.36,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空 小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.33,0:13:54.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.64,0:13:58.85,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,呀哈哈哈哈... 傻子！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.07,0:14:05.24,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,撂下那個龍套 自己逃走不就好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.53,0:14:10.81,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,呀哈哈哈哈... 呀哈哈哈哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.00,0:14:16.41,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,呀哈哈哈哈... 呀哈哈哈哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.60,0:14:19.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呀哈哈哈哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.81,0:14:24.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快住口... 不許你嘲笑...
Dialogue: 1,0:14:20.81,0:14:24.06,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(2500,0)}快住口... 不許你嘲笑...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.47,0:14:27.13,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.83,0:14:33.04,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.88,0:14:38.38,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,這種光芒是...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.28,0:14:41.45,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是Precure的光芒！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.63,0:14:43.53,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,開... 開玩笑的吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.03,0:14:48.87,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,那個龍套... 也能變成Precure嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.68,0:14:52.54,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我想 在我迎來彌留之際
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.20,0:14:56.35,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,會回想起來的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.46,0:14:59.94,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,不是嘲笑過我的人們
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.91,0:15:06.09,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,而是保護了我的公主 您啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.91,0:15:11.48,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,現在還不是那個時候
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.42,0:15:15.80,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,因為從此刻起 我要保護您！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.70,0:15:19.24,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.43,0:15:20.64,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,少做夢了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.23,0:15:24.36,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.55,0:15:25.72,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,公主！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.93,0:15:29.30,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.88,0:15:32.85,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.01,0:15:33.88,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,打到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.27,0:15:35.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.83,0:15:38.21,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,怎... 怎麼可能...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.03,0:15:44.72,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！趁現在！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.19,0:15:51.61,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,Precure！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.22,0:15:58.55,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,天空公主
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.40,0:16:01.44,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,您的騎士前來救駕！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.77,0:16:08.13,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,天空幻鏡！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.77,0:16:08.13,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Sky Mirage！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.04,0:16:11.73,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,天籟接通！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.04,0:16:11.73,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Tone Connect！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.55,0:16:18.20,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,海闊天空變身！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.87,0:16:20.79,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,飛翼！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.87,0:16:20.79,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Wing！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.18,0:16:30.51,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,閃耀起步！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.18,0:16:30.51,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(995,970)}HOP
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.21,0:16:38.64,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,爽朗飛奔！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.21,0:16:38.64,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(995,970)}STEP
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.91,0:16:46.65,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,暢快躍起！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.91,0:16:46.65,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(995,970)}JUMP
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.94,0:17:09.92,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,高闊凌雲的勇氣！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.82,0:17:12.25,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,Cure Wing！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.82,0:17:12.25,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}飛翼愈衛！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.81,0:17:33.40,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,Cure... Wing...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.26,0:17:50.60,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,翱翔天際的Precure...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.45,0:17:55.76,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,阿翼 你的努力成功了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.24,0:18:01.72,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,欸... 哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.98,0:18:08.25,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,別放手！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.93,0:18:09.75,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.22,0:18:22.68,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,Wing！小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.24,0:18:24.18,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.54,0:18:26.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不錯啊！少年！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.83,0:18:29.03,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,飛起來了...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.10,0:18:33.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算你問我是怎麼飛起來的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.89,0:18:36.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸只是拚了命要救你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.70,0:18:42.84,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,我不承認！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.08,0:18:45.97,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,就算能飛 又怎麼樣！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.25,0:18:50.26,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,更強的人！可是！老子！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.67,0:18:54.17,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,他又要打那一招了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.45,0:18:56.24,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,別再妄想了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.48,0:18:59.63,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,因為... 我們有Cure Wing了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.48,0:19:01.42,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.21,0:19:03.28,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空空！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.86,0:19:08.34,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,是 我去一下 公主！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.45,0:19:14.33,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你有本事儘管來啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.83,0:19:18.12,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,一旦下定決心 就要永不言棄
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.58,0:19:19.68,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,這才是英雄！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.15,0:19:21.82,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,對！我決定了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.75,0:19:24.32,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我 Cure Wing！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.02,0:19:27.92,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,要保護公主！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.84,0:19:33.84,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄氣闊！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.01,0:19:36.21,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,飛翼衝擊！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.01,0:19:36.21,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Wing Attack！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.80,0:19:46.64,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,討厭死了！為什麼又輸了啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.23,0:19:48.71,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,好燙！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.72,0:19:51.47,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,卡疤痛痛！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.51,0:20:00.69,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,Sky！Prism！後面就交給你們了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.00,0:20:04.28,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空空！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.93,0:20:15.96,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,天空藍！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.93,0:20:15.96,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Sky Blue！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.39,0:20:20.71,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,稜鏡白！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.39,0:20:20.71,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Prism White！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
