Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.75,0:21:00.89,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,你辦到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.65,0:21:04.11,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空空！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.30,0:21:09.62,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
