Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.70,0:21:23.32,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,欸... “小空今天的體重”
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.77,0:21:25.53,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.99,0:21:29.26,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.17,0:21:32.00,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,欸...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.84,0:21:34.54,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.68,0:21:35.82,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,愛
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.96,0:21:37.01,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哈哈哈
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.27,0:21:39.89,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,不愧是騎士啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.57,0:21:45.16,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,晴雯麗...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.44,0:21:47.64,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,非常感謝你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.16,0:21:50.53,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？我什麼都沒做...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.05,0:21:54.42,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.52,0:21:58.98,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.87,0:22:09.14,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,今天是我 Cure Wing！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.87,0:22:09.14,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(1060,970)}飛翼愈衛
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.71,0:22:12.58,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,大家 請試著跟我一起跳吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.12,0:23:49.79,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我想為阿翼辦一場歡迎派對 你們覺得怎麼樣？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.96,0:23:50.76,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,要的要的！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.92,0:23:52.21,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,要做些什麼菜？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.46,0:23:55.43,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,說到派對美食 當然是燒鯛魚吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.62,0:23:57.52,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？燒鯛魚？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.53,0:23:59.97,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Hirogaru Sky！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.53,0:23:59.97,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}海闊天空！光之美少女
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.21,0:24:03.13,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,唔唔唔！回憶中的菜是什麼味道的!?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.31,0:00:32.52,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}（衝上藍天！）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.52,0:00:38.11,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飛 超越雲巔
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.32,0:00:43.66,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,飛吧！向著海闊天空的世界 Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.66,0:00:51.38,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（晴空萬里 美麗藍天 翱翔吧）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.58,0:00:56.53,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,雨後初霽天空稜鏡折射出彩虹
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.74,0:01:00.74,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,藍天的景色預告著有好事發生
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.74,0:01:02.26,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（藍天的景色）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.26,0:01:06.56,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,想要確認一下 便伸直了雙手
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.12,0:01:11.12,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,抓住了名為希望的光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.23,0:01:13.08,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,秒速緊握！緊緊握住！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.23,0:01:17.69,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,戰勝絕望吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.05,0:01:21.64,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,我們能堅強
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.64,0:01:25.03,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}擦乾眼淚
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.68,0:01:25.03,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}（你已經做好準備了嗎）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.03,0:01:27.06,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}飛躍而起
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.43,0:01:27.06,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}(讓我們張開勇氣之翼）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.41,0:01:32.79,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飛 朝氣蓬勃
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.00,0:01:37.46,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,把煩躁化為光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.71,0:01:42.76,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,未知的世界 未來的圖景 充滿著可能
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.93,0:01:47.50,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,與在同一片藍天下的伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.89,0:01:50.31,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,一起喚起通向明日的奇蹟！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.41,0:01:58.32,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄少女 海闊天空！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.00,0:22:29.67,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,太棒了!! 晴空萬里
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.67,0:22:34.23,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,那是能實現夢想與心願的蔚藍
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.40,0:22:37.01,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,打開心中的麥克風
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.01,0:22:38.82,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,輕輕哼唱起！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.82,0:22:41.20,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,希望的旋律♪
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.66,0:22:44.12,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HD5B8FD&\3c&HBD9CDF&\4c&HBE9EDE&}今天心情愉快
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.12,0:22:46.08,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HEBC278&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&}如果能與你分享
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.08,0:22:48.75,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,就能打開心靈+門扉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.83,0:22:51.54,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HEBC278&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&}稍等片刻！我已經激動到勢不可擋!!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.54,0:22:53.21,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HD5B8FD&\3c&HBD9CDF&\4c&HBE9EDE&}笑容也在合唱！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.34,0:22:55.88,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,來吧☆我的好朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.02,0:23:02.44,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HD5B8FD&\3c&HBD9CDF&\4c&HBE9EDE&}還是那條街 {\c&HEBC278&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&}就像平日裡
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.15,0:23:08.27,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都在那裡 這便是奇蹟啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.27,0:23:10.61,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,是我的寶貝！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.32,0:23:14.99,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都過來！傳開這韻律
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.99,0:23:19.25,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,手牽起手 心連起心
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.25,0:23:25.33,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,用溫暖的關懷 培育出的勇氣 是無窮無窮的∞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.42,0:23:29.59,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,積極的圖示是標記
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.59,0:23:33.76,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,想要更了解！這海闊天空的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.76,0:23:37.46,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,讓我們展開翅膀 飛向藍天
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.46,0:23:38.85,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,連接起人與人
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.85,0:23:41.56,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,Precure 笑容的圓環！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
